; ============================================================
; THE BYZANTINE SHADOW -- MODULE 09 CAPITAL REGISTRY
; ============================================================

; UserPatch cost-data commands require their four-goal vectors to
; begin in the legal extended-goal range 41-508. 594-597 are the
; public Shadow capital outputs, so the engine cost-delta action uses
; this separate scratch vector and Module 09 then copies it into
; the public output slots.
